    <outline text="PodShow Alley? No Damn Announcement on DSC?">
      <outline text="Hey AC,&#10;&#10;So rather than stir up controvery and talking behind ya back talk&#10;Podcast Alley and other forums about the acquisition. I'll just ask&#10;directly...&#10;&#10;A lot folks (not me) were surprised about the acquisition. Maybe you&#10;can say a few words on the DSC now that the deal is done.&#10;&#10;Cheers,&#10;Jeff&#10;--&#10;Podcast Shuffle Show&#10;Web: www.podcastshuffle.com &lt;http://www.podcastshuffle.com/&gt;&#10;RSS: feeds.feedburner.com—PodcastShuffleShow &lt;http://feeds.feedburner.com/PodcastShuffleShow&gt;"/>
    </outline>
